Usage: agent-deck list [options]

List all sessions.
ACCOUNT shows the quoted stored account slot, not a resolved account or login identity.
JSON always includes the raw "account" string, including "" when no slot is stored.

Options:

Examples:
  agent-deck list                    # List from default profile
  agent-deck -p work list            # List from 'work' profile
  agent-deck list --all              # List from all profiles
